0188: blueline cameras: read-only sensor chip-ID probe (bluecam=N)

bluecam=1 (rear IMX363), 2 (both front IMX355s), 3 (both groups). Powers
one group up in the stock order (AVDD switch GPIO, LVS1 1.8 V by RPMh,
reset), runs MCLK at 19.2 MHz from XO (no PLL), reads the Sony model ID
(0x0016) over a bit-banged camera control bus, then powers down and puts
every pin, clock and vote back as found. The camera clock controller is
touched only when GCC's camera AHB and XO branches run. Bus reads are
skipped when the lines are not both high. Log prefix "BLUE CAM:".

